생성 속도를 높일 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"에","x":347,"y":581,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스","x":392,"y":581,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"생성","x":536,"y":581,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"속도를","x":609,"y":581,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"높일","x":714,"y":580,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":787,"y":581,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":831,"y":581,"width":65,"height":35}]},{"text":"이 장에서는 가상 메모리 시스템의 위와 같은-또는 또 다른-장점들에 대해 더 깊이 살","words":[{"text":"이","x":287,"y":700,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"장에서는","x":332,"y":701,"width":134,"height":35},{"text":"가상","x":480,"y":700,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":556,"y":700,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"시스템의","x":664,"y":699,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"위와","x":799,"y":701,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"같은-또는","x":871,"y":700,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"또","x":1033,"y":705,"width":31,"height":26},{"text":"다른-장점들에","x":1076,"y":700,"width":211,"height":36},{"text":"대해","x":1304,"y":700,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":1379,"y":701,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"깊이","x":1424,"y":700,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"살","x":1499,"y":700,"width":35,"height":35}]},{"text":"펴볼 것이다. 먼저 요구 페이징을 통한 가상 메모리 구현에 대해 살펴보자.","words":[{"text":"펴볼","x":288,"y":760,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":368,"y":761,"width":105,"height":35},{"text":"먼저","x":489,"y":760,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"요구","x":564,"y":762,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"페이징을","x":640,"y":759,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"통한","x":774,"y":760,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"가상","x":848,"y":760,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":919,"y":760,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"구현에","x":1019,"y":760,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"대해","x":1122,"y":760,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":1192,"y":760,"width":131,"height":35}]},{"text":"10.2 요구 페이징 Demand Paging","words":[{"text":"10.2","x":158,"y":904,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"요구","x":310,"y":902,"width":79,"height":35},{"text":"페이징","x":403,"y":901,"width":111,"height":42},{"text":"Demand","x":548,"y":912,"width":150,"height":25},{"text":"Paging","x":708,"y":911,"width":119,"height":32}]},{"text":"어떻게 실행 프로그램을 보조저장장지에서 메모리로 적재할 수 있을지 생각해 보자. 한","words":[{"text":"어떻게","x":292,"y":995,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"실행","x":406,"y":996,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램을","x":485,"y":996,"width":162,"height":35},{"text":"보조저장장지에서","x":660,"y":995,"width":243,"height":36},{"text":"메모리로","x":920,"y":994,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"적재할","x":1055,"y":994,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":1155,"y":995,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있을지","x":1201,"y":994,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"생각해","x":1304,"y":994,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"보자.","x":1412,"y":993,"width":73,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":1501,"y":994,"width":35,"height":33}]},{"text":"가지 방법은 프로그램 실행 시작 시 프로그램의 전부를 물리 메모리에 적재하는 것이다.","words":[{"text":"가지","x":292,"y":1055,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"방법은","x":371,"y":1056,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램","x":483,"y":1056,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"실행","x":626,"y":1056,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"시작","x":701,"y":1056,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"시","x":775,"y":1055,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램의","x":817,"y":1054,"width":148,"height":36},{"text":"전부를","x":982,"y":1055,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"물리","x":1083,"y":1054,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"메모리에","x":1155,"y":1054,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"적재하는","x":1289,"y":1054,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":1429,"y":1053,"width":105,"height":35}]},{"text":"그러나 이 방법의 문제는 초기에는 프로그램의 전체가 메모리에 있을 필요는 없을지도","words":[{"text":"그러나","x":291,"y":1115,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":409,"y":1116,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"방법의","x":456,"y":1115,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"문제는","x":567,"y":1116,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"초기에는","x":677,"y":1115,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램의","x":816,"y":1115,"width":148,"height":35},{"text":"전체가","x":982,"y":1115,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"메모리에","x":1086,"y":1114,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"있을","x":1221,"y":1115,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"필요는","x":1295,"y":1115,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"없을지도","x":1405,"y":1112,"width":131,"height":36}]},{"text":"모른다는 점이다. 시작 시에 사용자가 여러 옵션 중에서 원하는 것을 선택하게 되어 있","words":[{"text":"모른다는","x":291,"y":1176,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"점이다.","x":442,"y":1176,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"시작","x":563,"y":1176,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"시에","x":640,"y":1176,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"사용자가","x":716,"y":1176,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":854,"y":1175,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"옵션","x":926,"y":1175,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"중에서","x":1000,"y":1176,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"원하는","x":1105,"y":1175,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"것을","x":1209,"y":1175,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"선택하게","x":1283,"y":1174,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"되어","x":1422,"y":1172,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"있","x":1504,"y":1172,"width":30,"height":36}]},{"text":"는 프로그램을 생각해 보자. 전체 프로그램을 적재하게 되면 실제 A卜\u0026자가 선택하느나","words":[{"text":"는","x":292,"y":1236,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"프로그램을","x":339,"y":1236,"width":167,"height":35},{"text":"생각해","x":520,"y":1236,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"보자.","x":630,"y":1236,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"전체","x":716,"y":1236,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램을","x":790,"y":1235,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"적재하게","x":956,"y":1235,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"되면","x":1090,"y":1235,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"실제","x":1162,"y":1235,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"A卜\u0026자가","x":1234,"y":1234,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"선택하느나","x":1371,"y":1233,"width":164,"height":37}]},{"text":"의 여부와는 상관없이 모든 옵션에 대한 코드를 적재하는 것이 된다.","words":[{"text":"의","x":294,"y":1295,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"여부와는","x":340,"y":1296,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"상관없이","x":482,"y":1296,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":624,"y":1298,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"옵션에","x":698,"y":1297,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":803,"y":1296,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"코드를","x":873,"y":1296,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"적재하는","x":977,"y":1296,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"것이","x":1109,"y":1296,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"된다.","x":1178,"y":1296,"width":67,"height":36}]},{"text":"다른 전략은 필요한 페이지만 적재하는 것이다. 이 기법을 요구 페이징(demand","words":[{"text":"다른","x":356,"y":1356,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"전략은","x":441,"y":1356,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"필요한","x":556,"y":1357,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"페이지만","x":669,"y":1357,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"적재하는","x":810,"y":1356,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":948,"y":1356,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1063,"y":1357,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"기법을","x":1108,"y":1356,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"요구","x":1212,"y":1358,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"페이징(demand","x":1289,"y":1354,"width":244,"height":39}]},{"text":"paging)이라고 하며 가상 메모리 시스템에서 일반적으로 사용된다. 요구 페이징 가상","words":[{"text":"paging)이라고","x":293,"y":1416,"width":232,"height":42},{"text":"하며","x":540,"y":1417,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"가상","x":620,"y":1417,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":698,"y":1417,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"시스템에서","x":806,"y":1416,"width":147,"height":37},{"text":"일반적으로","x":974,"y":1417,"width":148,"height":36},{"text":"사용된다.","x":1136,"y":1416,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"요구","x":1280,"y":1418,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"페이징","x":1357,"y":1415,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"가상","x":1468,"y":1415,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"메모리를 시용하면 프로그램 실행 중 필요할 때만 페이지가 적재된다. 따라서 접근되지","words":[{"text":"메모리를","x":295,"y":1475,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"시용하면","x":441,"y":1476,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램","x":586,"y":1478,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"실행","x":727,"y":1477,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"중","x":800,"y":1479,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"필요할","x":845,"y":1477,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"때만","x":950,"y":1477,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"페이지가","x":1022,"y":1477,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"적재된다.","x":1155,"y":1477,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":1297,"y":1476,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"접근되지","x":1405,"y":1476,"width":125,"height":36}]},{"text":"않은 페이지는 물리 메모리로 적재되지 않는다. 요구 페이징 시스템은 프로세스가 보조","words":[{"text":"않은","x":296,"y":1535,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"페이지는","x":376,"y":1536,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"물리","x":521,"y":1537,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"메모리로","x":600,"y":1537,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"적재되지","x":740,"y":1537,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":876,"y":1537,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"요구","x":986,"y":1540,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"페이징","x":1061,"y":1538,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"시스템은","x":1163,"y":1537,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1297,"y":1536,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"보조","x":1469,"y":1539,"width":65,"height":28}]},{"text":"메모리(일반적으로 HDD 또는 NVM 장치)에 상주하는 스와핑(9.5.2절)을 사용하는 페","words":[{"text":"메모리(일반적으로","x":296,"y":1595,"width":276,"height":39},{"text":"HDD","x":584,"y":1600,"width":87,"height":28},{"text":"또는","x":683,"y":1599,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"NVM","x":756,"y":1600,"width":89,"height":29},{"text":"장치)에","x":857,"y":1597,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"상주하는","x":971,"y":1598,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"스와핑(9.5.2절)을","x":1102,"y":1597,"width":247,"height":40},{"text":"사용하는","x":1360,"y":1597,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"페","x":1502,"y":1598,"width":29,"height":35}]},{"text":"이정 시스템과 유사하다. 요구 페이징은 가상 메모리의 주요 이점 중 하나를 설명한다.","words":[{"text":"이정","x":297,"y":1654,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"시스템과","x":378,"y":1656,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"유사하다.","x":523,"y":1656,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"요구","x":676,"y":1659,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"페이징은","x":753,"y":1657,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"가상","x":889,"y":1657,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"