. 그러나 9.3.3절에서외는 달리 이 비트가 “유효(vaild)”하다고 설정되면 해당 페이","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":301,"y":2139,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"그러나","x":391,"y":2141,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"9.3.3절에서외는","x":505,"y":2141,"width":232,"height":36},{"text":"달리","x":749,"y":2141,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":823,"y":2141,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"비트가","x":865,"y":2140,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"“유효(vaild)”하다고","x":963,"y":2139,"width":276,"height":40},{"text":"설정되면","x":1252,"y":2139,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"해당","x":1392,"y":2140,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"페이","x":1470,"y":2140,"width":61,"height":36}]},{"text":"지가 메모리에 있다는 의미이고, “무효(invalid)”하다고 설정되면 해당 페이지가 유효하","words":[{"text":"지가","x":301,"y":2198,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"메모리에","x":381,"y":2200,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"있다는","x":529,"y":2201,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"의미이고,","x":636,"y":2201,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"“무효(invalid)”하다고","x":779,"y":2200,"width":299,"height":39},{"text":"설정되면","x":1090,"y":2199,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"해당","x":1223,"y":2198,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"페이지가","x":1298,"y":2199,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"유효하","x":1436,"y":2200,"width":100,"height":35}]},{"text":"지 않거나(즉, 가상 주소 공간상에 정의되지 않았거나) 유효하지만 보조저장장치에 존재","words":[{"text":"지","x":302,"y":2258,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"않거나(즉,","x":348,"y":2259,"width":155,"height":40},{"text":"가상","x":517,"y":2260,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"주소","x":594,"y":2262,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"공간상에","x":669,"y":2260,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"정의되지","x":804,"y":2260,"width":112,"height":36},{"text":"않았거나)","x":931,"y":2259,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"유효하지만","x":1069,"y":2258,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"보조저장장치에","x":1233,"y":2258,"width":222,"height":38},{"text":"존재","x":1470,"y":2259,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"한다는 것을 의미한다. 메모리에 올라오는 페이지에 대해서는 유효로 설정하며, 현재 메","words":[{"text":"한다는","x":301,"y":2318,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"것을","x":418,"y":2319,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"의미한다.","x":497,"y":2319,"width":135,"height":36},{"text":"메모리에","x":648,"y":2320,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"올라오는","x":781,"y":2320,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"페이지에","x":911,"y":2320,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"대해서는","x":1039,"y":2318,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"유효로","x":1169,"y":2318,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"설정하며,","x":1276,"y":2319,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"현재","x":1425,"y":2320,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"메","x":1504,"y":2319,"width":28,"height":36}]},{"text":"모리에 올라와 있지 않은 페이지의 페이지 테이블 항목은 무효로 설정하기만 한다. 그림","words":[{"text":"모리에","x":301,"y":2378,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"올라와","x":414,"y":2378,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"있지","x":531,"y":2378,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"않은","x":606,"y":2379,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"페이지의","x":681,"y":2379,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":813,"y":2379,"width":83,"height":36},{"text":"테이블","x":912,"y":2379,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"항목은","x":1009,"y":2379,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"무효로","x":1109,"y":2379,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"설정하기만","x":1213,"y":2377,"width":159,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1383,"y":2379,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"그림","x":1470,"y":2379,"width":62,"height":35}]}]}